---LINES
ok	= gv - - - - "[ ok ]"
err	= ge - - - - "[ exit= 1 ]"





---SCREEN
=command run & exit code indicator

  when command is done, You get an indicator in one of form:

  .ok...       -- on success

  .err........ -- if a command terminated with error or on a signal

  Warning about defencive trap:
    .:NL... does nothing preventing unexpected action
                                  
  Pass codes:
  .:SP... or .:CA...        return to main menu
  .:HE...                   get this page then returns to main menu
  .:AU... .:AD... .:AR...   return to command editor, cursor at the end 
  .:AL...                   return to command editor, cursor at last position

  other printable:	    type another command from scratch

	
---END
